{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己找出怎样喜欢才不会受伤，先停下反复盘算该收住还是放开。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复盘算\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼对方自愿靠近，不想对方为安抚他才照他的期待答应；对方未必和他想得一样，这样相处会不自在。\",\n      \"key\": \"自愿靠近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"虽仍没有答案，安心靠近、真心给予、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜都曾让他快乐，也让他知道这个人有多重要。\",\n      \"key\": \"曾让他快乐\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"以后若等不到对方主动靠近，他还是会疼，这不等于他先前的喜欢是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"喜欢是假的\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被这个人选择，也愿继续喜欢，不再靠收住心意证明自己没陷进去。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿继续喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想让对方自愿靠近、不想对方只为安抚他而答应的意思，补明对方未必和他想得一样，若硬要对方顺着自己的期待，相处就会不自在；其余条目不变。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9caeed0c-3e06-42f0-8e63-a8fef94d54db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T142529521339Z", "elapsed_seconds": 681.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T14:36:51.291380+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "756e76cc746586b4812f4dd09f10be31523d7a0a593dd0c78fe2530b0e6f64b0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", 